<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>我的扣子智能体作品</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7f6; padding: 40px; color: #333; }
        h1 { text-align: center; color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .container { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); width: 380px; padding: 25px; text-align: center; transition: transform 0.3s; }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); }
        .card h2 { font-size: 20px; color: #34495e; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .card p { font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: left; }
        /* 图片样式，设置了底部边距 */
        .card img { width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid #eee; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background-color: #ff6b81; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; }
        .btn:hover { background-color: #ff4757; }
        .back-link { display: block; text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; color: #3498db; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>🤖 我的扣子 (Coze) 智能体作品</h1>
    
    <div class="container">
        <!-- 卡片1：推书热点雷达 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>📚 推书热点雷达</h2>
            <p>定时抓取全网热搜，通过大模型智能筛选与书籍相关的热点，自动生成推荐文案并推送到微信。</p>
            <!-- 这里放推书的两张图 -->
            <img src="coze-workflows/tuishu-1.jpg" alt="推书截图1">
            <img src="coze-workflows/tuishu-2.jpg" alt="推书截图2">
            <br>
            <a href="https://www.coze.cn/store/agent/7674995400046379034?bot_id=true" target="_blank" class="btn">✨ 前往体验</a>
        </div>

        <!-- 卡片2：AI 短剧工作流 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>🎬 AI 短剧自动化生成</h2>
            <p>输入主题或大纲，利用扣子工作流调用大模型，自动完成分镜拆解、文案生成与画面提示词输出。</p>
            <!-- 这里放漫剧的两张图 -->
            <img src="coze-workflows/manju-1.jpg" alt="漫剧截图1">
            <img src="coze-workflows/manju-2.jpg" alt="漫剧截图2">
            <br>
            <a href="https://www.coze.cn/store/agent/7675976525506166835?bot_id=true" target="_blank" class="btn">✨ 前往体验</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <a href="index.html" class="back-link">⬅️ 返回我的个人主页</a>
</body>
</html>
